-- Migration: Import Chemical Stock (Chemical Stoack 22-9-2026.xlsx)
-- Source sheets: WB (Wetblue -> type Wet-end) and Finish (Finishing -> type Finishing).
-- Imports 208 distinct materials with quantity (KGS) and rate.
-- Suppliers are matched to existing supplier names (spelling variants normalised).
-- Idempotent: each material is skipped if a material with the same name already exists.
-- Material codes continue sequentially from the current MAX(MAT-#####) via a session
-- variable, so this migration is safe regardless of how many materials already exist.

-- Seed the counter from the current highest MAT code.
SET @mat_seq = (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(CAST(SUBSTRING(code, 5) AS UNSIGNED)), 0) FROM materials WHERE code LIKE 'MAT-%');

-- =============================================
-- Insert materials with supplier reference, opening stock (KGS) and rate.
-- current_stock/opening_stock = KGS, rate/last_purchase_price/standard_cost = Rate.
-- @mat_seq is only advanced when a new row is actually inserted (NOT EXISTS check).
-- =============================================

